6904140	 <P_f_Footnote>A vertical wedge of the erased sign is still visible. Possibly, the scribe first intended to write <SP_f_AO_3a_SIGN>MA</SP_f_AO_3a_SIGN> or <SP_f_AO_3a_SIGN>TA</SP_f_AO_3a_SIGN>.</P_f_Footnote>
